## 5. Judgment Layer (human-written, about five lines)

What the team learned this sprint and what it changes about the plan.

This sprint, we learned what actually needs to be done by us every sprint. We felt overwhelmed by the assignments due the week and it was hard for us to understand
what needed to be done by sprint 1. This project has little guidance, so it is being built from scratch. This made it difficult to understand where to start. We 
also just met out with our project partner last week, which made it harder to understand what we should have done. But we learned that we need to get started 
earlier and have a working product by hopefully next sprint to show to the TA and project partner.
